      "content": "Let me read both the original test and the CUT source.Now I understand the original test. I'll improve it by removing unused imports and the unused helper method, and adding clear section comments to explain the logical flow.The improved test compiles successfully. The changes made were: removed three unused imports (`Field`, `Map`, `AtomicInteger`) and the dead `tagSetNamespaceCount` helper method, then added focused inline comments that explain each logical phase of the test — what known tags are, why `FOO` normalizes to `foo`, and why the namespace lookup returns null."
